{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45446","headline":"八月十五夜翫月 · 栖白","name":"八月十五夜翫月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寻常三五夜，不是不婵娟。\n及至中秋满，还胜别夜圆。\n清光凝有露，皓魄爽无烟。\n自古人皆望，年来又一年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"栖白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45446.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45446","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}